ww.tandfonline.com\/journals\/cjut20).<br>The data consist of three appendices as follows:<br>- Appendix A - List of user stories and associated tasks for a Noise Action Planning (NAP)<br>workshop. User stories were collected during an online workshop with professional<br>participants.<br>- Appendix C - Glossary. List of technical terms used in the manuscript associated. It facilitates<br>understanding the full article.<br>- Appendix D - Short description of German terms used in the tool. The tool described in the<br>manuscript presents a list of German terms that non- german speakers might find difficult to<br>understand. This appendix briefly describes those terms.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2023-03-06"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Issued: 2021-10-12"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Co-design"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2023-03-06"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2023-03-07"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2023-03-06"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Dr. ROSA Aguilar (University of Twente)","Dr. Rosa Aguilar (University of Twente)"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":t